%% state_04_task_assignment.mmd — TaskAssignment Status
%% Updated 2026-07-10 (verified).
%% Ref: task_assignment model (assignment_status: active/completed/cancelled)
%% Completion can trigger missing ReviewSession creation as backstop, not guaranteed first creation path.

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active : Assignment created\n(via approve application\nor manual assign)

    active --> completed : Task enters DONE category\n→ auto-mark completed\n→ emit completion backstop flow
    active --> cancelled : Task cancelled or\nassignment revoked

    completed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]

    note right of active
        assigned_at = auto-set on creation.
        estimated_hours, actual_hours tracked.
        assignment_type: member/external_contributor/volunteer.
    end note

    note right of completed
        Completion keeps review mandatory,
        but session may already exist from
        completion-package submit path.
        If missing, backstop listener can:
        1. Create ReviewSession (status=pending)
        2. Seed reviewer assignments
        3. Use governance deadline helper
           (~72 hours default)
    end note
